# Hollowmoth party banter (Dialogue Manager 4 syntax).
# Lines whose speaker is dead or missing are skipped by scripts/banter.gd.
# Speakers: Average, Puck, Nana, Brokk, Eowilas

~ encounter_average
% Average: LOOK AT ME! Over here! I'm the big one!
% Average: Finally! Something worth hitting!
% Average: Watch this. Everybody watch this.
% Average: Line up, I've got one axe and all night.
=> END

~ encounter_puck
% Puck: Oh, hey. Company. Not the good kind.
% Puck: Easy, everyone. Deep breaths. Then stab.
% Puck: Nana, you seeing this? ...Yeah, me neither, kind of blurry.
% Nana: Mind your footing, sweetheart. And your manners.
=> END

~ encounter_brokk
% Brokk: Another lot for the book. I've got ink to spare.
% Brokk: Stand still so I can shoot you, you hollow wretches.
% Brokk: Oi! Big lad! Don't get in my line again.
% Brokk: Right. Count 'em. I want credit for every one.
=> END

~ encounter_sael
% Eowilas: No chains on you tonight, but no mercy either.
% Eowilas: Black Butterfly, guide my hand. It needs guiding.
% Eowilas: Stay close. I can't mend what I can't reach.
% Eowilas: They were people once. Let's end it quickly.
=> END

~ clear_average
% Average: Did everyone see that? Tell me someone saw that.
% Average: Ha! Too easy. Bring a bigger one.
% Average: I'm not even tired. Slightly tired. Not really.
=> END

~ clear_puck
% Puck: Cool. Cool cool cool. We're alive.
% Puck: Somebody check their pockets for snacks.
% Nana: That's my boy. Now eat something, you're all bones.
=> END

~ clear_brokk
% Brokk: Seven for me. Don't argue, I counted.
% Brokk: Sloppy. All of you. Including me. Mostly you.
% Brokk: Into the book you go. Page forty-two.
=> END

~ clear_sael
% Eowilas: Rest now. Whatever bound you is broken.
% Eowilas: Anyone bleeding? Speak up, pride heals slower than skin.
% Eowilas: The moths will carry them off. Let's keep moving.
=> END

~ lowhp_average
% Average: That one... counted. Only a bit.
% Average: I'm FINE. This is how I look when I'm winning.
=> END

~ lowhp_puck
% Puck: Ow. Okay. Okay, that one was real.
% Nana: Puck! Drink something this instant!
=> END

~ lowhp_brokk
% Brokk: Agh! Write that down, someone. In red.
% Brokk: I'll be adding you to the book, sunshine.
=> END

~ lowhp_sael
% Eowilas: I'm hurt. Someone cover me while I pray.
% Eowilas: Not yet. The Butterfly isn't done with me.
=> END

~ revived_average
% Average: I wasn't dead. I was resting dramatically.
=> END

~ revived_puck
% Puck: Whoa. Saw a big moth. It said hi.
% Nana: Don't you ever scare me like that again.
=> END

~ revived_brokk
% Brokk: Nobody saw that. That goes nowhere near the book.
=> END

~ revived_sael
% Eowilas: Thank you. I owe you a sunrise.
=> END

~ levelup
% Average: I feel BIGGER. Can you tell? You can tell.
% Brokk: Stronger. Still surrounded by amateurs, but stronger.
% Eowilas: The shrine's light remembers us. Good.
% Puck: Huh. I feel... wiser? Or hungrier. One of those.
=> END

