~ banter_1
Brokk: Elf. Your moth keeps landing on my beard.
Eowilas: She likes you.
Brokk: Well, I don't like her. ...She can stay.
=> END

~ banter_2
Average: Puck, how are you not scared of anything?
Puck: Fear's just your body being dramatic, man.
Nana: He fell out of a tree at six and laughed the whole way down.
=> END

~ banter_3
Eowilas: Brokk, why do you keep a book of grudges?
Brokk: Because if I kept them in my head there'd be no room for anything else.
=> END

~ banter_4
Average: When this is over, they'll carve a statue of me.
Brokk: They'll carve a warning.
Average: Same thing, if it's big enough.
=> END

~ banter_5
Puck: This forest smells like wet regret.
Eowilas: That's the gibbets.
Puck: Yeah. That's what I said.
=> END

~ banter_6
Nana: Eowilas, dear, you stand like someone who's been in chains.
Eowilas: I was. Once.
Nana: Well, you're not now. Shoulders back.
=> END

~ banter_7
Brokk: Barbarian. You're walking on my side of the road.
Average: Roads have sides?
Brokk: They do when I'm on them.
=> END

~ banter_8
Puck: Do you think the stars mind going out?
Eowilas: I think someone is putting them out. That's different.
Puck: Heavy. Okay. Walking quietly now.
=> END

~ banter_9
Average: Eowilas. Pray for me to get bigger.
Eowilas: She doesn't take requests about muscles.
Average: Then what's the point of her?
Eowilas: Freedom, Average. Even yours.
=> END

~ banter_10
Brokk: Page eleven. The rain. Page twelve: the mud. Page thirteen: Average.
Average: I got a whole page?
Brokk: You've got a chapter.
=> END

~ banter_11
Eowilas: When I was a slave, I counted the bars every night.
Brokk: How many?
Eowilas: Nine. Now I count stars instead. Fewer every night.
Brokk: ...I'll add whoever's doing it to the book.
=> END

~ banter_12
Average: My father fought the Iron Brother three times.
Puck: And?
Average: He lost three times. But he looked AMAZING doing it.
=> END

~ banter_13
Brokk: Arcane archery is a science, barbarian. Angles. Wind. Hatred.
Average: Mine is a science too. Hit. Hit again.
Brokk: That's not a science, that's a weather pattern.
=> END

~ banter_14
Eowilas: Average, you take every blow meant for us. Why?
Average: Because when they hit me, they're LOOKING at me.
Eowilas: ...That's almost noble.
Average: It's completely noble.
=> END

~ banter_15
Brokk: Elf. Do you ever stop smiling?
Eowilas: I spent years not being allowed to. I'm catching up.
Brokk: Hmph. Carry on, then.
=> END

~ banter_16
Puck: Brokk, is there anyone NOT in your book?
Brokk: Nana.
Nana: Oh, Brokk. That's lovely.
Brokk: She's in the other book.
=> END

