~ banter2_2
Eowilas: These chains in the ash... they go on for miles.
Brokk: Someone forged all this. Someone very patient and very stupid.
Eowilas: We'll break them. Every one.
=> END

~ banter2_3
Puck: Ash tastes like burnt toast, if the toast was sad.
Nana: Don't lick the ground, sweetheart.
Puck: I didn't. Not on purpose.
=> END

~ banter2_4
Brokk: Dragon. A real dragon. I've got one page left in this book.
Average: Save it for me, when I win.
Brokk: It's for the dragon. You'll get a footnote.
=> END

~ banter2_5
Average: If I die out here, tell them I was huge.
Eowilas: You won't die. I won't let you.
Average: ...Tell them anyway.
=> END

~ banter2_6
